{
  "name": "Onboarding Actions",
  "description": "What we will do for a new hire who is stuck: the cause, the plan, an owner and a date.",
  "position": 2,
  "agentPrompts": [
    {
      "key": "propose-action",
      "label": {
        "en": "Propose an action for a new hire who is stuck",
        "zh-CN": "为一位卡住的新员工提出跟进措施"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Read the `busa-onboarding` skill in this folder and follow it. For the new hire I name, read their signals and score, explain in two or three sentences where they are stuck, and add one action with a concrete plan, an owner and a due date. Before the start date, the date is before day one. The owner is the person who can fix it — IT, People or the manager — not the new hire.",
        "zh-CN": "先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-onboarding` Skill，按它的规则做。针对我说的新员工，读他的信号和评分，用两三句话说明卡在哪里，然后加一条跟进措施，写清具体计划、负责人和截止日期。还没入职的，截止日期要在入职第一天之前。负责人是能解决问题的人——IT、人力或直属经理——而不是新员工本人。"
      },
      "intent": "change"
    },
    {
      "key": "chase-actions",
      "label": {
        "en": "Which onboarding actions are overdue?",
        "zh-CN": "哪些跟进措施已经超期"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Read the `busa-onboarding` skill in this folder and follow it. List open actions past their due date with their owner and new hire, and say whether that new hire’s score has moved since the action was opened. Do not change anything.",
        "zh-CN": "先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-onboarding` Skill，按它的规则做。列出超过截止日期仍未完成的跟进措施、负责人和对应新员工，并说明措施开出以后这位新员工的评分有没有变化。不要修改任何记录。"
      },
      "intent": "read-only"
    }
  ],
